[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6246.047, "timestamp": "01:44:06", "text": "所以，如果已經有了交易，就趕快成交吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6248.791, "timestamp": "01:44:08", "text": "等等，啊，是的。我必須"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6254.839, "timestamp": "01:44:14", "text": "結束直播。我來了。所以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6259.32, "timestamp": "01:44:19", "text": "是的，我們會完成的。抱歉"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6262.104, "timestamp": "01:44:22", "text": "直播時間很短，只有2小時。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6262.805, "timestamp": "01:44:22", "text": "但是如果。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6265.004, "timestamp": "01:44:25", "text": "圖表上小於 6。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6269.434, "timestamp": "01:44:29", "text": "2 小時很短，而 6 小時很長。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6273.868, "timestamp": "01:44:33", "text": "你知道，你知道該怎麼做"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6277.717, "timestamp": "01:44:37", "text": "你知道我覺得我的身高有多矮嗎？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6280.405, "timestamp": "01:44:40", "text": "對我來說，4小時的直播時間太短了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6282.892, "timestamp": "01:44:42", "text": "我們過去常說短，但現在是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6288.169, "timestamp": "01:44:48", "text": "只要，但它高於"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6288.669, "timestamp": "01:44:48", "text": "平均的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6290.969, "timestamp": "01:44:50", "text": "是的。"}]